%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0fd4c3c83fae23b4cae61c12ce438472, type: 3}
  m_Name: Carpenter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Craftsman
  defaultPath:
    pathName: Introduction
    paragraphs:
    - New face... you live over in that run down cabin?
    - It's a sore on the eyes. Maybe we can fix that.
    - My wide assortment of vanity is sure to spruce up that dingy abode.
    emotions: 000000000300000001000000
  repeatedItemPath:
    pathName: Again...?
    paragraphs:
    - Oh joy.... {itemName}.... Again....  {itemGiven}
    emotions: 03000000
  paths:
  - pathName: Buy something!
    paragraphs:
    - Feel free to browse my selection. The large hanging sign will let you know
      what I need to construct what you want.
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Want to buy this?
    paragraphs:
    - The {storeItemName}? That will run you {storeItemValue} <color=#E0D38F>Mints</color>
      <sprite index=0>. {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 04000000
  - pathName: Sold!
    paragraphs:
    - You sure you don't want the warranty? {itemBought}  {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: No Money
    paragraphs:
    - Did you leave all of your money in your little piggy bank?
    emotions: 04000000
  - pathName: No Space
    paragraphs:
    - You seem to have an inventory problem. A chest would fix that for you!
    emotions: 02000000
  - pathName: Want To Trade for this?
    paragraphs:
    - The {storeItemName}? If you give me some supplies I can make you one.  {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Not Enough Items
    paragraphs:
    - Unfortunately, I am a craftsman. Not a magician.
    emotions: 02000000
  - pathName: Have a Chest
    paragraphs:
    - With all of those crops you are gonna grow, you are gonna need a place to store
      them. {freezePlayer}
    - Here, this should help. You can place it inside your cabin. {givePlayerItems}
    emotions: 0100000000000000
  fillerPaths:
  - pathName: Back to glory
    paragraphs:
    - I hope that one day, we can get this town back to it's former glory.
    - 'To bear witness to all the outside dilapidation: it aches my soul.'
    emotions: 0000000002000000
  - pathName: Gloomstalk
    paragraphs:
    - The mist has brought alot of turmoil to these lands, but it has also blessed
      us with new innovations.
    - Take the gloomstalk for example. Great for binding, weaving, and for feeding
      livestock! I have never worked with such a versatile material before!
    emotions: 0000000001000000
  - pathName: Lumberjack Beef
    paragraphs:
    - I have little patience for that LumberJack.
    - So unmotivated, so lazy. It pains me to have my line of work overlap with his.
    emotions: 0300000002000000
  - pathName: My Vanity
    paragraphs:
    - I am aware that my furnishing trade is of little importance to the survival
      of Veilwood.
    - However, the vanity alleviates the mind from our current situation. For a time,
      that is.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  - pathName: I Try to Help
    paragraphs:
    - Our town being under a constant threat has forced us to adapt our trades to
      ensure our survival.
    - I pray the crude bulwarks of defense I prepare serve their purpose well.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  - pathName: Want to fix ruined houses
    paragraphs:
    - So badly do I wish to go beyond the town walls, and repair what was taken from
      us.
    - So much Infrastructure. So much property. Reduced to listless rubble.
    emotions: 0000000002000000
  questPaths: []
  itemRecievedPaths:
  - pathName: Go Sell it instead
    paragraphs:
    - I don't have much use for something like that.
    - If you are looking to sell your stuff, I bet that weird wagon fellow will purchase
      it.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  itemSpecificRemarks:
  - pathName: Go Sell it instead
    paragraphs:
    - What do you take me for, a charity?
    - I have need to spend my precious <color=#E0D38F> Mints</color> <sprite index=0>
      on your junk.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  - pathName: Ear/Stalk
    paragraphs:
    - If you let me refine those for you, I can use them to make you some structures
      for your farm.
    - Unlike the Wagon Man, I won't scam you out of all your mints.
    emotions: 0000000003000000
  - pathName: Timber/Bundles/Rocks
    paragraphs:
    - Some fine quality resources. I can make you some constructions with those.
    emotions: 01000000
  friendshipPath1: []
  friendshipPath2: []
  friendshipPath3: []
  alreadySpoken:
  - pathName: ...
    paragraphs:
    - '...

'
    emotions: 06000000
  branchingPaths: []
  questCompletePaths:
  - pathName: Default Quest Complete
    paragraphs:
    - Thank you for completing my quest!
    emotions: 01000000
  dailyQuestPaths:
  - pathName: Daily Quest
    paragraphs:
    - Friend, it is good to see you. If you are open to some extra work, I could
      use a hand with something.
    emotions: 01000000
